[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Set up my AI assistant (Telegram)
Name[he]=הגדרת העוזר האישי (טלגרם)
Comment=One-time setup of the local assistant. Needs a Telegram bot token from @BotFather if you want Telegram.
Exec=konsole -e bash -lc 'openclaw onboard --install-daemon; echo; read -r -p "Press Enter to close"'
Icon=utilities-terminal
Categories=Utility;
